# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
# The app needs no secrets: the Supabase URL and publishable key are public and live in
# js/config.js. These are only for the Supabase CLI on your own machine, and both are
# optional: `npx supabase login` keeps the token in the CLI's own store, and
# `npx supabase link` / `db push` ask for the database password when it isn't set.
# Load them into the shell yourself before running the CLI; nothing reads this file.
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-personal-access-token
# SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD=your-database-password
#
# Never put the secret (service_role) key anywhere in this repo, not even in .env.
